			"date": "2026-11-06T22:59:28.668Z",
			"content": "<p>The boring fix that worked: our key pages (changelog, both licenses, plans, privacy, refunds) now also ship as markdown. Plus we've got a <a href=\"https://fontawesome.com/llms.txt\">fontawesome.com/llms.txt</a> as a front door for agents. Turns out the answer to \"AI can't read our site\" was just... plain text. Duh.</p>",
